---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const lastUpdated = "May 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Moka Bio"
  description="How Moka Bio collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-header">
      <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-freshgreen/25 to-transparent"></div>
      <p class="legal-kicker">LEGAL</p>
      <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-body">
      <div class="legal-intro">
        <p>
          Moka Bio ("we", "us", "our") is committed to protecting your personal information.
          This policy explains what data we collect when you visit <strong>moka.bio</strong>,
          how we use it, and what rights you have over it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information in two ways:</p>

        <h3>Information you provide directly</h3>
        <p>When you submit the contact form on our site, we collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name</li>
          <li>Your email address</li>
          <li>Your phone number (optional)</li>
          <li>The message you send us</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This information is used solely to respond to your inquiry.</p>

        <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
        <p>
          We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> (GA4) to understand how visitors interact with our site.
          Google Analytics collects anonymized data including pages visited, time on site, and general
          geographic location (country/city level). No personally identifiable information is sent to Google Analytics.
        </p>
        <p>
          Google Analytics uses cookies to track sessions. You can opt out at any time using
          <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Google's opt-out browser add-on
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>2. How we use your data</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact form submissions</strong> — to respond to your message and follow up on your inquiry.</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics data</strong> — to improve our website content and user experience. We never sell this data.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not use your personal data for automated decision-making or profiling.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>3. Data storage and retention</h2>
        <p>
          Contact form submissions are sent directly via email to our team at
          <a href="mailto:info@moka.bio">info@moka.bio</a> and stored in our email system.
          We retain this data for as long as necessary to fulfill the purpose of your inquiry,
          and no longer than 3 years unless a business relationship requires otherwise.
        </p>
        <p>
          Analytics data is retained in Google Analytics for 14 months, in line with Google's default settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>4. Data sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We may share data with:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google LLC</strong> — for analytics purposes, governed by <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
          <li><strong>Legal authorities</strong> — only if required by applicable law.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
        <p>Our site uses the following cookies:</p>
        <div class="legal-table-wrap">
          <table class="legal-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Cookie</th>
                <th>Provider</th>
                <th>Purpose</th>
                <th>Expires</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>_ga</td>
                <td>Google Analytics</td>
                <td>Distinguishes users</td>
                <td>2 years</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>_ga_*</td>
                <td>Google Analytics</td>
                <td>Maintains session state</td>
                <td>2 years</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p>We do not use advertising, tracking, or third-party marketing cookies.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>6. Your rights (GDPR)</h2>
        <p>If you are located in the European Economic Area, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Access</strong> the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li><strong>Correct</strong> inaccurate data</li>
          <li><strong>Request deletion</strong> of your data ("right to be forgotten")</li>
          <li><strong>Restrict or object</strong> to certain types of processing</li>
          <li><strong>Data portability</strong> — receive your data in a structured, machine-readable format</li>
          <li><strong>Withdraw consent</strong> at any time</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, email us at
          <a href="mailto:info@moka.bio">info@moka.bio</a>.
          We will respond within 30 days.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>7. International data transfers</h2>
        <p>
          Moka Bio operates globally. If you are visiting from outside the country where our
          servers are located, your data may be transferred internationally. Where required,
          we apply appropriate safeguards in accordance with applicable data protection laws.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post the revised version
          on this page with an updated date. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes
          acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>9. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy? Reach us at:</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Moka Bio</strong><br />
          <a href="mailto:info@moka.bio">info@moka.bio</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    background: var(--charcoal-color);
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  .legal-header {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.06);
  }

  .legal-kicker {
    font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.46em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--fresh-green-color);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--pure-color);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-family: Roboto, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.35);
  }

  /* ── Body ─────────────────────────────────────── */
  .legal-body {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 6rem;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.72);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(110, 191, 126, 0.14);
    background: rgba(19, 45, 37, 0.28);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.06);
  }

  .legal-section:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--pure-color);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-section h3 {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.78);
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.62);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.62);
    list-style: disc;
  }

  .legal-section a {
    color: var(--fresh-green-color);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(110, 191, 126, 0.3);
    transition: border-color 200ms;
  }

  .legal-section a:hover {
    border-color: var(--fresh-green-color);
  }

  .legal-section strong {
    color: rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.85);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ── Table ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .legal-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.08);
  }

  .legal-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .legal-table th {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.5);
    background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.6);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.08);
  }

  .legal-table td {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    color: rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.62);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(222, 222, 222, 0.05);
  }

  .legal-table tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
</style>
